{"guid": "N60_019", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "equalizer (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, an equalizer is a goal that makes the scores of the competing teams level.", "translations": {"en": "equalizer", "lt": "išlyginamasis įvartis", "zh": "扳平比分的进球", "fr": "but égalisateur", "es": "gol del empate", "es-419": "gol del empate"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_020", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "hat trick (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a hat trick is when one player scores three goals or points in a single game.", "translations": {"en": "hat trick", "lt": "hat-trikas", "zh": "帽子戏法", "fr": "triplé", "es": "triplete", "es-419": "triplete"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_021", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "set (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports such as tennis, a set is a unit of a match made up of a group of games or points.", "translations": {"en": "set", "lt": "setas", "zh": "盘", "fr": "set", "es": "set", "es-419": "set"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_022", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "match point (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a match point is a point that, if won by a player or team, ends the match in their favor.", "translations": {"en": "match point", "lt": "mačo taškas", "zh": "赛点", "fr": "balle de match", "es": "punto de partido", "es-419": "punto de partido"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_023", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "singles (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, singles is a match in which one player competes against one other player.", "translations": {"en": "singles", "lt": "vienetų rungtynės", "zh": "单打比赛", "fr": "match en simple", "es": "partido individual", "es-419": "partido individual"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_024", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "doubles (sports)", "concept_definition": "A sports match in which two pairs of players compete against each other.", "translations": {"en": "doubles", "lt": "dvejetų varžybos", "zh": "双打", "fr": "double", "es": "dobles", "es-419": "dobles"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_025", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "heat (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a heat is one of several preliminary races or contests in which competitors try to qualify for a later round.", "translations": {"en": "heat", "lt": "atrankos rungtis", "zh": "预赛", "fr": "série qualificative", "es": "serie clasificatoria", "es-419": "serie clasificatoria"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_026", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "relay (sports)", "concept_definition": "A relay is a race in which team members take turns completing parts of the course, usually passing an object such as a baton between them.", "translations": {"en": "relay", "lt": "estafetė", "zh": "接力赛", "fr": "course de relais", "es": "carrera de relevos", "es-419": "carrera de relevos"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_027", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "false start (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a false start is starting a race or play before the official signal or permitted time.", "translations": {"en": "false start", "lt": "klaidingas startas", "zh": "抢跑", "fr": "faux départ", "es": "salida en falso", "es-419": "salida en falso"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_028", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "photo finish (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a photo finish is a race finish so close that a photograph or finish-line camera is needed to determine which competitor crossed first.", "translations": {"en": "photo finish", "lt": "fotofinišas", "zh": "摄影终点判定", "fr": "photo-finish", "es": "foto de llegada", "es-419": "foto de llegada"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N60_029", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "rule_defined_event", "concept_label": "doping (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, doping is the illegal use of drugs or other banned substances to improve an athlete’s performance.", "translations": {"en": "doping", "lt": "dopingo vartojimas", "zh": "兴奋剂违规使用", "fr": "dopage", "es": "dopaje", "es-419": "dopaje"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
